The 35 shape outlines in shapes.json are Material Design shapes, ported to the
web by material-shapes-ts (https://github.com/ruanspies/material-shapes-ts) from
AndroidX Graphics Shapes. Both are licensed under the Apache License 2.0, a copy
of which sits beside this file.

Regenerate with: node tools/fetch-shapes.mjs

Coordinates live in the normalized [0, 1] shape space, so a path renders at its
native proportions inside viewBox="0 0 1 1".
